     "code": "Q126: Shallow Copy\n  Original: [1, [2, 3], {'a': 4}]\n  Copy:     [1, [2, 3], {'a': 4}]\n  Are same object? False\n  Nested list shared? True\n\n  After shallow[1].append(99):\n  Original: [1, [2, 3, 99], {'a': 4}]\n  Copy:     [1, [2, 3, 99], {'a': 4}]\n\n  After shallow[0] = 999:\n  Original: [1, [2, 3, 99], {'a': 4}]\n  Copy:     [999, [2, 3, 99], {'a': 4}]",
